        "status": "final",
        "code": {
          "text": "Neck pain"
        },
        "subject": {
          "reference": "Patient/patient-1"
        },
        "valueString": "Ongoing midline and paraspinal neck pain radiating into the right shoulder; reported severity 4–7/10. Worse at the end of the workday, while sitting at a computer, and while driving."
      }
    },
    {
      "fullUrl": "https://example.org/fhir/Observation/observation-6",
      "resource": {
        "resourceType": "Observation",
        "id": "observation-6",
        "status": "final",
        "code": {
          "text": "Intermittent limb heaviness and motor sensations"
        },
        "subject": {
          "reference": "Patient/patient-1"
        },
        "valueString": "Patient reports intermittent heaviness and a shaky, clumsy, 'feels off' sensation in the right arm more than the left, and sometimes the right leg. Episodes last minutes to 1 hour and occur several times per day. Onset timing is uncertain and the patient has given varying accounts: possibly last week or possibly straight after the crash. Still able to type and lift light objects."
      }
    },
    {
      "fullUrl": "https://example.org/fhir/Observation/observation-7",
      "resource": {
        "resourceType": "Observation",
        "id": "observation-7",
        "status": "final",
        "code": {
          "text": "Intermittent tingling"
        },
        "subject": {
          "reference": "Patient/patient-1"
        },
        "valueString": "Patient reports intermittent tingling in the right forearm and hand, not clearly dermatomal."
      }
    },
    {
      "fullUrl": "https://example.org/fhir/Observation/observation-8",
      "resource": {
        "resourceType": "Observation",
        "id": "observation-8",
        "status": "final",
        "code": {
          "text": "Reported numbness and red-flag symptoms"
        },
        "subject": {
          "reference": "Patient/patient-1"
        },
        "valueString": "Denies numbness, saddle anaesthesia, and bowel or bladder change."
      }
    },
    {
